zoterostyle-column-functions = Columns
zoterostyle-column-functions-introduce = Columns created or modified by Style for Zotero. You need to enable them manually. In the Zotero main interface, click View in the Zotero top bar, then Columns, and check the ones you want to display. Each column has corresponding settings. You can right-click any column name in the main interface to access the column settings for further customization.
